# Rom and Leeta, Unlikely Pair: "each turn" counts any turn (CR 603.2). On Bot2's second turn Bot1's Opt is its
# second draw of the game and the trigger fires: two tapped Treasure tokens arrive as it resolves (CR 111.10a). A
# second Opt is a further draw and makes no third token - the ability fired once for the turn.
